FN("ST_CENTROID", "ST_Centroid(mpoly)", "Returns a point reflecting the mathematical centroid (geometric center) for the MultiPolygon mpoly. The resulting point will not necessarily be on the MultiPolygon.", "https://mariadb.com/kb/en/st_centroid/")
